       >>SOURCE FORMAT FREE
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. ACCOUNT-SUMMARY.

DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-ACCOUNT-NAME          PIC X(24) VALUE "SAMPLE CUSTOMER".
01 WS-OPENING-BALANCE       PIC S9(7)V99 COMP-3 VALUE 1250.00.
01 WS-CLOSING-BALANCE       PIC S9(7)V99 COMP-3 VALUE ZERO.
01 WS-TRANSACTION-COUNT     PIC 9 VALUE 3.
01 WS-TRANSACTIONS.
   05 WS-TRANSACTION-AMOUNT PIC S9(7)V99 COMP-3 OCCURS 3 TIMES.
01 WS-INDEX                 PIC 9 VALUE ZERO.
01 WS-DISPLAY-BALANCE       PIC -(7)9.99.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN.
    MOVE 125.50 TO WS-TRANSACTION-AMOUNT(1)
    MOVE -40.00 TO WS-TRANSACTION-AMOUNT(2)
    MOVE -10.25 TO WS-TRANSACTION-AMOUNT(3)

    MOVE WS-OPENING-BALANCE TO WS-CLOSING-BALANCE
    PERFORM VARYING WS-INDEX FROM 1 BY 1
        UNTIL WS-INDEX > WS-TRANSACTION-COUNT
        ADD WS-TRANSACTION-AMOUNT(WS-INDEX) TO WS-CLOSING-BALANCE
    END-PERFORM

    DISPLAY "ACCOUNT SUMMARY FOR " FUNCTION TRIM(WS-ACCOUNT-NAME)
    MOVE WS-OPENING-BALANCE TO WS-DISPLAY-BALANCE
    DISPLAY "Opening balance: " WS-DISPLAY-BALANCE
    MOVE WS-CLOSING-BALANCE TO WS-DISPLAY-BALANCE
    DISPLAY "Closing balance: " WS-DISPLAY-BALANCE
    STOP RUN.
